bin/
obj/
site-*/
site-*
work/
golden/
*.user
.vs/
.DS_Store

# Session-to-session working notes for AI-assisted development (plan.md, continue.md,
# todo.md and their -hardening siblings) live here, excluded from the public repo —
# kept locally, untracked. Named explicitly (not just relying on *.md below) so the
# whole folder stays ignored even if a non-.md scratch file ends up in it.
prompts/

# Ignore Markdown files by default, but keep the project docs tracked.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!CLAUDE.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
# User-facing documentation for the tool itself, as opposed to the repo's own notes.
!IDIOTS-GUIDE.md
!HOW-TO-USE.md
# Project-scoped agent skills are documentation of this repo's own conventions and
# belong to it, not to whoever happens to have it checked out.
!.claude/skills/**/*.md
